      <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">

  
    
  <h1 class="content-title text-center">FDA requires warnings about increased risk of serious heart-related events, cancer, blood clots, and death for JAK inhibitors that treat certain chronic inflammatory conditions</h1>
  
  					<p class="article-subtitle text-center">Approved uses also being limited to certain patients</p>
	</div>

  </section>






