          <li><a href="/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/prescribe-confidence" class="lcds-section-nav__section-link lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link">Prescribe with Confidence</a></li>
          <li><a href="/drugs/drug-safety-and-availability/risk-evaluation-and-mitigation-strategies-rems" class="lcds-section-nav__section-link lcds-section-nav__link lcds-section-nav--side__link">Risk Evaluation and Mitigation Strategies | REMS</a></li>
